-DENABLE_OPENMP=OFF: no OpenMP runtime is packaged for the clang/lld
toolchain, and find_package(OpenMP REQUIRED) fails outright without it.
Purely an internal-parallelism speedup, invisible to consumers like
lxqt-runner. -DENABLE_SAMPLES=OFF skips the example binaries. Also dropped
the generic cmake-template's Qt-private-header CMAKE_CXX_FLAGS block -
muparser is plain C++, not a Qt/LXQt consumer, and doesn't need it.
